UnitDiscountRegistry::GetDiscount
├── when origin eq caller and has pool discount
│   ├── it uses 2 SLOADs
│   └── it returns pool discount
├── when origin eq caller and has no pool discount or it is zero
│   ├── it uses at least 1 SLOAD and at most 2 SLOADs
│   └── it returns discount value for origin
├── when origin doesn't eq caller and caller has pool discount and it is gt zero
│   ├── it uses 2 SLOADs
│   └── it returns caller's pool discount
└── when origin doesn't eq caller and caller doesn't have pool discount or it is zero
    ├── when caller has discount
    │   ├── it uses at least 1 SLOAD and at most 2 SLOADs
    │   └── it returns caller's discount
    └── when caller doesn't have discount
        ├── when origin has pool discount and it is gt zero
        │   ├── it uses at least 3 SLOADs and at most 4 SLOADs
        │   └── it returns origin's pool discount
        └── when origin doesn't have pool discount or it is zero
            ├── it uses at least 2 SLOADs and at most 4 SLOADs
            └── it returns discount value for origin
